@cc [owner:jchen0824,label:architecture] search-bootstrap-runtime-assets
The core runtime image must contain `elasticsearch_create_index`,
`qdrant_create_collection`, and the core Elasticsearch index settings/mappings.
The front-workers image must contain the bundled front index bootstrap and its
settings/mappings. Deployment bootstrap runs these from their expected working
directories with a region whose settings files are packaged in the images.

@cc [owner:jchen0824,label:architecture] connectors-runtime-assets
The connectors image must contain, under `/app/connectors`, `dist/start_server.js`,
`dist/start_worker.js`, `dist/migrate.js`, `dist/temporal-bundles/<worker>.bundle.js`
for every worker a deployment selects with `--workers` (the POC selects `dust_project`),
and every `migrations/pre-deploy/*.sql` file from the checkout. It must also contain
`/app/scripts/db/run-migrate.cjs` and `psql`, and default to the `/app/connectors`
working directory. Deployments run connectors processes from `/app/connectors` with
`NODE_ENV=production`.
